flowchart TD
    Inputs["Workflow, tabular inputs and optional sampling configuration"] --> Validate["Validate package identity, schemas, units, evidence and coverage"]
    Validate --> Boundary["Define sourcing landscape<br/>Polygon or household points with travel assumptions"]
    Boundary --> Harvest["Resolve estimated annual harvest<br/>Annual total or household woody biomass use and household counts"]
    Boundary --> Resources["Prepare accessible resource records<br/>Land cover, eligibility, exclusions and ecological zones"]
    Harvest --> Prepare["Intersect native stock cells with resource area and zones<br/>Preserve source-cell identities"]
    Resources --> Prepare
    Stock["AGB or canopy cover<br/>Matching uncertainty and growth parameters"] --> Prepare
    Prepare --> Classify{"Classification uncertainty configured?"}
    Classify -->|Yes| Candidates["Prepare candidate resource support and matrix evidence"]
    Classify -->|No| Nominal["Run nominal annual model<br/>Concurrent logistic growth and prescribed harvesting"]
    Candidates --> Nominal
    Candidates -. supports later sampling .-> Sample
    Nominal --> Account["Account for regeneration, realised and unrealised harvest<br/>NRB = max of zero and H minus R<br/>fNRB = NRB divided by H when H is positive"]
    Account --> NominalOut["Export nominal tables, Excel, GIS and provenance"]
    NominalOut --> Mode{"Monte Carlo requested?"}
    Mode -->|No| Review["Review results, flags and scientific limitations"]
    Mode -->|Yes| Sample["Sample configured stock, parameters and annual harvest<br/>Optionally sample land-cover resource eligibility"]
    Sample --> Draw["Run annual model for the draw<br/>Record metrics and sampled parameters"]
    Draw --> Save["Save draws and periodic checkpoints"]
    Save --> Check{"At a scheduled precision check<br/>Are stopping conditions met?"}
    Check -->|Continue within iteration limit| Sample
    Check -->|Precision met or iteration limit reached| Exports["Export Monte Carlo summaries and spatial statistics<br/>Optionally export GIS for every draw"]
    Exports --> Review
    Resume["Resume a saved assessment"] --> Compatible["Verify compatible files, code, runtime and checkpoint"]
    Compatible --> Restored{"Simulation already complete?"}
    Restored -->|No| Sample
    Restored -->|Yes| Exports
    Saved["Completed assessment records"] --> Replay["Verify and replay a selected iteration<br/>or regenerate spatial summaries"]
    Exports --> Saved
    Replay --> Review
